        "notes": "Here is where some build synergy starts. Pick up Gloomgauntlet for some insane heals as both Baby and Mecha Dva, and to help with this we take Meka Punch. One thing to know about Gloomgauntlet is that it does not stack, it simply refreshes the timer on the heal. It DOES increase melee damage, and the reset on boosters allows you to keep dropping lava with Ignition Burst.\n\nYou still need to be careful with being close range until you pick up Nano Cola Nitrous, but currently, it takes 6-8 melee hits to remech if you don't shoot.\n\nAt this point, save your ult for guaranteed remeching, not as an offensive option for the rest of the game.",
