        "created_at": "2025-07-30T11:39:38.64408+00:00",
        "notes": "Here we have several options for both powers and items.\n\nUltrawide Matrix: Eat more, heal more, it's pretty simple, take this as the default option if you're not sure what to go for. With Stat Boost, if you're getting melee kills and resetting boosters through Meka Punch, you can recover matrix faster! Express Detonation makes your bomb exploding faster means possible picks when remeching, but you also remech faster! Party Protector is a free 250 overhealth for you and your team if you get demeched with bomb\n\nSiphon Gloves has the highest sustainability when you're Baby, but isn't great for when you're in mech, so you can keep it or swap it for several options. Nebula Conduit takes very bursty damage from characters like Freja and Cas and turns it into damage over time, meaning it's a lot easier to mitigate with your self healing. Martian Mender does 17 healing / sec as baby, and 38 / sec in mech and some solid cooldown reduction. If you're not being demeched often, take Vanadium injection for some general stat boosts!",
